   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "colab-tips"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 💡 Colab Tips\n",
    "\n",
    "### Keep Your Session Alive\n",
    "\n",
    "Colab sessions **disconnect after inactivity**. Here's how to keep it running:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Manual Refresh**: Just click anywhere in the notebook every few minutes\n",
    "2. **JavaScript Keep-Alive** (Recommended):\n",
    "\n",
    "```javascript\n",
    "// Run this in a browser console on your Colab page\n",
    "function keepAlive() {\n",
    "  const event = new MouseEvent('mousemove', {\n",
    "    view: window,\n",
    "    bubbles: true,\n",
    "    cancelable: true\n",
    "  });\n",
    "  document.dispatchEvent(event);\n",
    "  console.log('Keep-alive ping at', new Date().toISOString());\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "// Ping every 5 minutes (300000ms)\n",
    "setInterval(keepAlive, 300000);\n",
    "keepAlive();\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Colab Pro**: Upgrade for longer sessions\n",
    "\n",
